", \\\"content\\\": \\\"30 grams \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"212 degrees Fahrenheit\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"100 degrees Celsius\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" 32 degrees Fahrenheit\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" 0 degrees Celsius\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Imperatives", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Use the Imperative to give instructions.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The Imperative only has one form. The subject is <span class=\"italic\">you</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "We often use the Imperative in recipes or cooking instructions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Place the ingredients in a bowl.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Mix the ingredients together. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Don't burn the cookies!", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Think of your favorite dish.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Do you know the recipe? If you don't, find it on the Internet.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write down 5-8 steps for the recipe.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Say the steps aloud to your partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask your partner to do the same with the recipe of his/her favorite dish. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write down your partner's recipe.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write the recipe of my favorite dish.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I give instructions in a recipe.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about food with my partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I listen to steps of a recipe and record the information.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "type"